{
  "oasis": 1,
  "title": "Quake II 3.20 for Linux in OpenGL (ref_gl, 3dfx) — id Software, with the 1998 demo's data",
  "year": 1998,
  "author": "id Software, port by Dave 'Zoid' Kirsch",
  "world": "linux",
  "thumb": "oasis/thumbs/linux-quake2-gl-1998.png",
  "machine": {
    "cpu": "686",
    "mem": 64,
    "hle": [
      "fxmesa",
      "glide"
    ]
  },
  "layers": [
    {
      "busybox": "https://busybox.net/downloads/binaries/1.35.0-i686-linux-musl/busybox"
    },
    {
      "deb": "http://archive.debian.org/debian-archive/debian/dists/bo/main/binary-i386/base/libc5_5.4.33-6.deb"
    },
    {
      "deb": "http://archive.debian.org/debian/dists/bo/main/binary-i386/base/ldso_1.8.12-1.deb"
    },
    {
      "deb": "http://archive.debian.org/debian/dists/bo/main/binary-i386/libs/svgalib1_1.2.10-5.deb"
    },
    {
      "deb": "http://archive.debian.org/debian-archive/debian/dists/bo/main/binary-i386/x11/xlib6_3.3-4.deb"
    },
    {
      "deb": "http://archive.debian.org/debian-archive/debian/dists/bo/main/binary-i386/x11/xext_3.3-4.deb"
    },
    {
      "tar": "https://ftp.fu-berlin.de/pc/games/idgames/idstuff/quake2/unix/quake2-3.20-i386-unknown-linux2.0.tar.gz",
      "into": "usr/games/quake2"
    },
    {
      "zip": "https://ftp.fu-berlin.de/pc/games/idgames/idstuff/quake2/q2-314-demo-x86.exe",
      "files": {
        "Install/Data/baseq2/pak0.pak": "/usr/games/quake2/baseq2/pak0.pak",
        "license.txt": "/usr/games/quake2/license.txt"
      }
    },
    {
      "file": "oasis/files/quake2.conf",
      "to": "/etc/quake2.conf"
    },
    {
      "links": {
        "/lib/ld-linux.so.1": "ld-linux.so.1.8.12",
        "/sbin/ldconfig": "ldconfig.new"
      }
    },
    {
      "file": "oasis/files/ld.so.conf-x11",
      "to": "/etc/ld.so.conf"
    },
    {
      "mkdir": [
        "/tmp",
        "/root"
      ]
    },
    {
      "run": "ldconfig",
      "cwd": "/"
    }
  ],
  "entry": {
    "run": "/usr/games/quake2/quake2",
    "args": [
      "+set",
      "vid_ref",
      "gl",
      "+set",
      "gl_driver",
      "libGL.so",
      "+set",
      "cd_nocd",
      "1"
    ],
    "cwd": "/usr/games/quake2",
    "console": true,
    "env": {
      "HOME": "/root",
      "TERM": "linux"
    }
  },
  "output": "window",
  "notes": "id's Linux Quake II 3.20 with its 3dfx OpenGL renderer, ref_gl.so: it dlopens libGL.so and finds OpenGL and fxMesa's full-screen calls in it with dlsym. That libMesaGL.so.2 is made in JavaScript by MIRAGE (src/hle/fxmesa.js), its OpenGL drawn by PRISM's gl.js on WebGL2; keyboard and mouse are Debian 1.3's svgalib. Data: the March 1998 demo's pak0.pak, its licence beside it.",
  "license": "https://ftp.fu-berlin.de/pc/games/idgames/idstuff/quake2/q2-314-demo-x86.exe",
  "licenseName": "id Software's Quake II demo licence (license.txt in the demo archive): free electronic redistribution with the licence",
  "caution": "The Quake II demo is id Software's, under its limited demo licence, not a free one: it may be passed on free of charge by electronic means, with its licence, for non-commercial use. MIRAGE never copies it: the page fetches id's archives unchanged.",
  "tags": [
    "game",
    "OpenGL",
    "3dfx",
    "SVGAlib"
  ],
  "sound": true
}
